&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Medical Science Liaison (MSL) in Neurology will serve as a scientific expert, fostering partnerships with healthcare professionals, clinical researchers, and advocacy groups in relevant disorders. The MSL will deliver high-quality scientific exchange, provide education on emerging data, support clinical trial execution, and capture insights that inform medical&amp;nbsp;affairs&amp;nbsp;strategy. The primary focus will be advancing the development of&amp;nbsp;telitacicept&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;myasthenia&amp;nbsp;gravis&amp;nbsp;(MG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
