&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Workhelix is a tech-enabled services company with a single goal: helping organizations get the most out of their AI investments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our people and software combine to give leaders answers to the three critical questions about the business value of AI:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Where are our top opportunities to create value with AI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Are our current efforts actually delivering? What’s their ROI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;How can we accelerate and increase the benefits of our AI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To find answers for each customer, Workhelix applies our unmatched expertise in economics, AI, and data science. We have pioneered a task-scoring method to identify top GenAI opportunities, ensuring clear, data-driven deployment strategies. Our ROI monitoring suite applies Nobel Prize-winning economics to provide accurate, ongoing insights into the impact of GenAI implementations. Renowned AI and Economics thinkers including Andrew Ng, and cofounders Andy McAfee and Erik Brynjolfsson stand proudly behind our mission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We maintain a culture established on five key principles. For more information on our leadership principles, please visit the careers page of our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a full-time opportunity open to job seekers in the Greater San Francisco area or to those who are willing to relocate there.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Workhelix, the Forward-Deployed Strategist is pivotal in transforming complex business challenges into actionable solutions. You&#39;ll be the bridge between customer needs, data insights, and service execution—ensuring that organizations can make better, faster, and smarter decisions with our expertise. This role combines analytical problem-solving, deep user empathy, and strategic execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage deeply with clients to understand their strategic goals, operational challenges, and data landscapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify critical workflows and data sources that drive AI adoption and business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead client workstreams with our Engineering and Product teams to design and deploy scalable, customized solutions that meet client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead client training sessions to ensure service adoption and empower users to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present strategic recommendations and deployment results to client executives, ensuring alignment on value realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to influence service enhancements based on field insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and deliver impactful demos to prospective and existing clients to showcase Workhelix’s value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope new engagement opportunities and assess how Workhelix can drive transformation across diverse industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse customer data using SQL to understand specific limitations and ways by which to mitigate these&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales colleagues to continuously deliver value for the customer and grow the ACV for Workhelix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution by running SteerCo meetings, managing agendas, documenting decisions, and sharing clear follow-ups to keep projects on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structure to ambiguous environments by organizing workstreams, maintaining alignment across stakeholders, and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical thinkers who thrive in ambiguous environments and approach challenges with curiosity and rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-centric mindset with a passion for translating complex data into software-led actionable strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team players with low ego and a strong desire to contribute to meaningful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive learners who adapt quickly and can guide, lead, and collaborate effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicators who can engage with stakeholders at every level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience working in client-facing roles, particularly in strategy or consulting with extensive experience working with and/or coordinating with internal engineering and data science teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to deliver results in complex organizational environments like B2B enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating complex data ecosystems and identifying insights that drive business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing novel software-led solutions to drive business outcomes for enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in ad-hoc data analysis and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel (about ~25%) as required by client and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in or willing to relocate to the San Francisco Bay Area for in-office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay range and compensation package &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;$145,000- $185,000 + Equity + Health Benefits&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package and benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Chance to learn and collaborate with some of the most famous researchers in the AI and digital economy space: Andrew Ng, Erik Brynjolfsson, Andy McAfee, and Daniel Rock.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The unique opportunity to help build a company, culture, and products from the ground up with a team that values healthy working practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A high-trust, high-autonomy work environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Workhelix, we stand committed to ensuring an environment of mutual respect where equal employment opportunities are available without any discrimination. We believe diversity is critical to our success. Selection for employment will solely be based on qualifications, merit, and business needs. We encourage all qualified individuals to apply!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7817831.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Oversea” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role in the Marketplace team is vital in achieving marketplace growth while delivering the best-in-class customer experience as well as seller experience. This role involves designing and implementing impactful processes and initiatives that span across various business and functional areas within Coupang. The sales operations Director will also lead the business planning, goal setting, measurement, tracking and reporting of marketplace business. The role will own rollout and adoption of key initiatives that are critical to seller acquisition and seller success on Coupang. By continually improving both supplier and internal processes, this role aims to identify gaps and drive strategic recommendations that align with Coupang’s corporate goals and objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Planning &amp;amp; Goal setting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own &amp;amp; drive the planning for entire marketplace business in collaboration with cross functional stakeholders to ensure the goals are aligned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure there are right metrics and frameworks to measure the goals effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Decision Making and Performance Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data to make informed decisions, track program performance, and identify areas for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop robust reporting systems and dashboards to provide insights to stakeholders and drive accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize seller feedback, customer feedback, market trends, and A/B testing to refine program initiatives and meet evolving business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive right processes and business reviews to monitor the objectives on a daily/weekly/monthly basis depending on the audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketplace growth, new initiatives and their GTM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate the ability to dive deep into understanding Coupang’s products, competitive landscape, seller expectations, and customer expectations to identify areas for marketplace growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate and drive seller focused initiatives keeping Coupang customers in mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a high quality GTM of any new initiatives to all relevant stakeholders and own new initiatives till they reach right levels of adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Diagnosis and Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dive deep into operational processes to diagnose gaps, identify improvement opportunities, and develop recommendations for future-state processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead process improvement efforts to streamline operations, increase efficiency, and validate improvement initiatives to ensure measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize PM methodologies to optimize processes and support continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Capability Building:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the sales teams with the right mechanisms and tools to improve conversion metrics across seller acquisition funnels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train the sales teams and improve AM pitch and enable them to have a high-quality outcome oriented interactions with the sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales performance &amp;amp; incentives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure fair and unbiased lead and account assignment logics to the sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive goal setting at an AM level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and track sales performance across metrics for seller acquisition and account management teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and drive efficient incentive structures for the sales team which help marketplace in meeting and exceeding goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Leadership and Execution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and guide project teams across various business lines, ensuring alignment on program goals and efficient execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the planning, design, and delivery of strategic initiatives, monitoring project progress and reporting results to senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and monitor success metrics, tracking project outcomes and adjusting approaches to ensure impactful results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration and Program Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior business leaders across Coupang to design and implement programs that drive operational and customer experience goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate findings effectively, ensuring actionable insights are followed through and fostering adoption through KPI-driven management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and support cross-functional teams in planning, designing, and executing end-to-end programs and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in program management, operations, or retail, with a strong focus on account management, sales and process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead complex, cross-functional projects and work effectively with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and experience using data-driven insights to inform decision-making and track program success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with program management tools and process improvement methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with a track record of influencing and leading cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-paced, high-growth retail, startup or e-commerce environment preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluence Mandarin and English communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Recruitment Process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
