&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helsing is a defence AI company. Our mission is to protect our democracies. We aim to achieve technological leadership, so that open societies can continue to make sovereign decisions and control their ethical standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As democracies, we believe we have a special responsibility to be thoughtful about the development and deployment of powerful technologies like AI. We take this responsibility seriously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are an ambitious and committed team of engineers, AI&amp;nbsp;specialists&amp;nbsp;and customer-facing programme managers. We are looking for mission-driven people to join our European&amp;nbsp;teams, and&amp;nbsp;apply their skills to solve the most complex and impactful problems. We embrace an open and transparent culture that welcomes healthy debates on the use of technology in defence, its benefits, and its ethical implications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW33472943 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW33472943 BCX0&quot;&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Lead Talent Acquisition Partner&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own end-to-end recruiting delivery across a portfolio spanning GTM, hardware, production, and non-engineering functions including security, data, IT, and product. Working in close partnership with hiring managers and the Talent team, you will translate hiring plans into structured, high-quality search processes. Your primary measure of success over the next year will be attracting, evaluating, and placing exceptional candidates across key business units, ensuring each hire advances Helsing&#39;s mission. This is a hands-on role that demands rigour, credible stakeholder relationships, and a genuine commitment to raising the standard of hiring quality as Helsing scales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW33472943 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
