&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To be considered for this role, you must meet the following essential qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Minimum&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;3&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;demonstrable&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Salesforce&amp;nbsp;platform&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;Salesforce&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Consultant or Developer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
